teViews.","+  - The preview layout on Android 12+.","+  - All of the brief step 7 checks.","+- **Error string:** the open question in tasks.md defaulted to reusing","+  `widget_action_failed`. I added `widget_time_tracking_failed` (\"Couldn't","+  update\") instead, because the existing German string (\"Abhaken","+  fehlgeschlagen\") means \"checking off failed\", which is wrong for start/stop.","+  Revert to reuse if that's preferred.","+- **For the translator:** all new de/fr/es/it strings are my own translations","+  and need a native-speaker check.","+- After a reboot, the chronometer base (from `elapsedRealtime`) is only correct","+  once the widget re-renders. A fetch on boot/update normally triggers that.","+- No unit tests: `org.json` is stubbed in local JVM tests, and testing would","+  need a new test dependency (not approved)."]}],"originalFile":"# Implementation: time tracking widget\n\nid: willing\ndeveloper:\ndate:\n\n<!-- Produced by @developer after implementation. -->\n\n## Summary\n\n<!-- What was implemented, task by task. Reference task IDs. -->\n\n## Changes\n\n<!-- List of files changed and what changed in each. -->\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups\n\n<!-- Anything that came up during implementation that wasn't in scope but should be tracked. -->\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Cp7mChuRP8p9SDL1Y7HAUG","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
